<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-011" chapter-id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan" source-id="s-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan-ws2288359">
  <p id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABA">孝武文穆王皇后</persName>諱<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan:p001:m0008" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABA">憲嫄</persName>，琅邪臨沂人也。元嘉二十年，拜武陵王妃，生<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan:p001:m0031" ref="iwn_c2g_zvh">廢帝</persName>、豫章王<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan:p001:m0037" ref="y7i_swu_xgh">子尚</persName>、山陰公主<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan:p001:m0044" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_C">楚玉</persName>、臨淮康哀公主<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan:p001:m0053" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_D">楚佩</persName>、皇女<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan:p001:m0058" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_E">楚琇</persName>、康樂公主<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan:p001:m0065" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_F">修明</persName>。<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan:p001:m0068" ref="hx8_st4_jdd">孝武</persName>在蕃，后甚寵異，及即位為皇后焉。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">大明四年，后率<rs id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan:p002:u0007" type="unresolved">六宮</rs>躬桑於西郊，皇太后觀禮，<rs id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan:p002:u0021" type="unresolved">妃主以下</rs>並加班錫。廢帝即位，尊曰<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan:p002:m0037" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABA">皇太后</persName>，宮曰永訓。其年崩于含章殿，祔葬景寧陵。父<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangxianyuan:p002:m0061" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAAB">偃</persName>別有傳。</p>
</text>
